comment_data.body:
I would also suggest not giving up on `quickfix` lists. Simply run `:cdo edit | cclose`, and it will have a similar effect. You can also replace `edit` with any other command you want to run, which is quite helpful.

```lua
quickfix = {
  char = "<C-q>",
  func = function()
    local all_items = MiniPick.get_picker_items()
    local marked = MiniPick.get_picker_matches().marked
    local choose = vim.tbl_isempty(marked) and all_items or marked
    MiniPick.default_choose_marked(choose, { list_type = "quickfix" })
  end,
},
```

